<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Smart India Hackathon 2026 - Registration Confirmation</title>
  <style>
    @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
      .main-container {
        padding: 16px 12px !important;
      }
      .content-card {
        padding: 24px 18px !important;
      }
      .meta-table td {
        display: block !important;
        width: 100% !important;
        box-sizing: border-box !important;
      }
      .meta-label {
        padding-bottom: 2px !important;
      }
      .meta-value {
        padding-bottom: 10px !important;
      }
      .btn-link {
        display: block !important;
        text-align: center !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f9fafb; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; color: #111827; line-height: 1.6; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;">

  <!-- Hidden Preheader Text for Email Clients -->
  <div style="display: none; font-size: 1px; color: #f9fafb; line-height: 1px; max-height: 0px; max-width: 0px; opacity: 0; overflow: hidden; mso-hide: all;">
    Internal Selection Round Registration Confirmation &bull; Team {{ team_number }} ({{ team_name }}) &bull; IIIT Bhopal
  </div>

  <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" class="main-container" style="background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 40px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <!-- Main Card Container -->
        <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" class="content-card" style="max-width: 620px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); overflow: hidden;">
          
          <!-- Top Accent Bar -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background-color: #111827; height: 5px; font-size: 0; line-height: 0;">&nbsp;</td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Content Body -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 36px 32px;">
              <!-- Header Section -->
              <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="margin-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 18px;">
                <tr>
                  <td>
                    <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #4b5563; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;">Indian Institute of Information Technology, Bhopal</span>
                    <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #111827; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">Smart India Hackathon 2026</h1>
                    <span style="font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; font-weight: 500; display: block; margin-top: 2px;">Internal Selection Round &bull; Registration Confirmation</span>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- Greeting -->
              <p style="margin: 0 0 14px 0; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #111827;">
                Dear {{ leader_name }},
              </p>
              
              <p style="margin: 0 0 28px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.65;">
                This email confirms that your team has successfully registered for the <strong>Internal Selection Round</strong> of Smart India Hackathon (SIH) 2026 at IIIT Bhopal. Below are your assigned team details, your allocated mentor, the mandatory PPT submission link, and event guidelines.
              </p>

              <!-- Section 1: Team & Mentor Details -->
              <h2 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #4b5563; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;">
                Team Details &amp; Mentor Allocation
              </h2>
              
              <div style="background-color: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 6px; padding: 18px 20px; margin-bottom: 28px;">
                <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" class="meta-table">
                  <tr style="vertical-align: top;">
                    <td width="35%" class="meta-label" style="padding: 5px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #4b5563;">Team ID:</td>
                    <td class="meta-value" style="padding: 5px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #111827;">{{ team_number }}</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr style="vertical-align: top;">
                    <td class="meta-label" style="padding: 5px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #4b5563;">Team Name:</td>
                    <td class="meta-value" style="padding: 5px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #111827; font-weight: 500;">{{ team_name }}</td>
                  </tr>
                  {% if track %}
                  <tr style="vertical-align: top;">
                    <td class="meta-label" style="padding: 5px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #4b5563;">Category of PS:</td>
                    <td class="meta-value" style="padding: 5px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #111827; font-weight: 500;">{{ track }}</td>
                  </tr>
                  {% endif %}
                  {% if mentor_allocated %}
                  <tr style="vertical-align: top;">
                    <td class="meta-label" style="padding: 5px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #4b5563;">Allocated Mentor:</td>
                    <td class="meta-value" style="padding: 5px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #111827; font-weight: 700;">{{ mentor_allocated }}</td>
                  </tr>
                  {% endif %}
                </table>
                <div style="margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px dashed #d1d5db; font-size: 11px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.5;">
                  <em>Note: Mentor allocation has been distributed fairly based on stated mentor preferences (priorities) and faculty availability.</em>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Section 2: Team Members Table -->
              <h2 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #4b5563; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;">
                Registered Team Members
              </h2>
              <div style="border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 28px;">
                <table border="0" cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="font-size: 13px; border-collapse: collapse; background-color: #ffffff;">
                  <thead>
                    <tr style="background-color: #f3f4f6; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: left; color: #4b5563; font-weight: 600; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">
                      <th style="padding: 10px 14px;">Name</th>
                      <th style="padding: 10px 14px;">Scholar No.</th>
                      <th style="padding: 10px 14px; text-align: center;">Gender</th>
                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody>
                    <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;">
                      <td style="padding: 10px 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #111827;">{{ leader.name }} <span style="font-size: 10px; background-color: #e5e7eb; color: #111827; padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 3px; font-weight: 600; margin-left: 4px;">Leader</span></td>
                      <td style="padding: 10px 14px; color: #4b5563;">{{ leader.scholar_id }}</td>
                      <td style="padding: 10px 14px; color: #4b5563; text-align: center;"><span style="background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500;">{{ leader.gender }}</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    {% for m in members %}
                    <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;">
                      <td style="padding: 10px 14px; color: #374151;">{{ m.name }}</td>
                      <td style="padding: 10px 14px; color: #4b5563;">{{ m.scholar_id }}</td>
                      <td style="padding: 10px 14px; color: #4b5563; text-align: center;"><span style="background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500;">{{ m.gender }}</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>

              <!-- Section 3: PPT Submission Box -->
              <div style="background-color: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #111827; border-left: 4px solid #111827; border-radius: 6px; padding: 18px 20px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <h3 style="margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #111827;">
                  Mandatory PPT Submission
                </h3>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.5;">
                  All registered teams must submit their presentation via the form below for evaluation:
                </p>
                <div style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
                  <a href="https://forms.gle/8n5jDnZwSFgnRixZ8" target="_blank" class="btn-link" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #111827; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; padding: 9px 18px; border-radius: 4px;">Submit Presentation (Google Form) &rarr;</a>
                </div>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 12px; color: #111827; font-weight: 600;">
                  PPT Submission Deadline: 11:00 AM, 2nd September 2026
                </p>
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.45;">
                  <em>Note: The evaluation team will evaluate all submitted PPTs and decide whether your team is shortlisted to deliver the physical presentation during the event.</em>
                </p>
              </div>

              <!-- Section 4: WhatsApp Group Box -->
              <div style="background-color: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 6px; padding: 18px 20px; margin-bottom: 28px;">
                <h3 style="margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #111827;">
                  Official WhatsApp Group
                </h3>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 14px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.5;">
                  Join the official WhatsApp group to receive further updates and announcements regarding the hackathon:
                </p>
                <div>
                  <a href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/KPdgd7TUcWTKHGKcHHHrMC" target="_blank" class="btn-link" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #111827; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; padding: 9px 18px; border-radius: 4px;">
                    <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="display: inline-table; vertical-align: middle;">
                      <tr>
                        <td style="vertical-align: middle; padding-right: 8px; line-height: 1;">
                          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#ffffff" style="display: block;">
                            <path d="M12.031 6.172c-3.181 0-5.767 2.586-5.768 5.766-.001 1.298.38 2.27 1.019 3.287l-.582 2.128 2.182-.573c.978.58 1.911.928 3.145.929 3.178 0 5.767-2.587 5.768-5.766.001-3.187-2.575-5.77-5.764-5.771zm3.392 8.244c-.144.405-.837.774-1.17.824-.299.045-.677.063-1.092-.069-.252-.08-.575-.187-.988-.365-1.739-.751-2.874-2.502-2.961-2.617-.087-.116-.708-.94-.708-1.793s.448-1.273.607-1.446c.159-.173.346-.217.462-.217l.332.006c.106.005.249-.04.39.298.144.347.491 1.2.534 1.287.043.087.072.188.014.304-.058.116-.087.188-.173.289l-.26.304c-.087.086-.177.18-.076.354.101.174.449.741.964 1.201.662.591 1.221.774 1.394.86.174.086.275.072.376-.044.101-.116.433-.506.549-.68.116-.173.231-.145.39-.087s1.011.477 1.184.564.289.13.332.202c.045.072.045.419-.099.824zm-3.392-10.416c-5.514 0-10 4.486-10 10 0 1.761.458 3.417 1.258 4.86l-1.297 4.74 4.864-1.276c1.392.76 2.977 1.196 4.675 1.196 5.514 0 10-4.486 10-10s-4.486-10-10-10z"/>
                          </svg>
                        </td>
                        <td style="vertical-align: middle; color: #ffffff; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1;">
                          Join WhatsApp Group
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Section 5: Event Schedule Box -->
              <div style="background-color: #f3f4f6; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 18px; margin-bottom: 28px;">
                <h3 style="margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #4b5563; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">
                  Internal Hackathon Schedule
                </h3>
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #111827; line-height: 1.5;">
                  <strong>Date:</strong> {{ event_date }}
                  <br>
                  <strong>Venue:</strong> {{ event_venue }}
                </p>
              </div>

              <!-- Section 6: Guidelines -->
              <h2 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #4b5563; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;">
                Participant Guidelines
              </h2>
              <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="font-size: 13px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 28px; line-height: 1.6;">
                <tr>
                  <td width="4%" style="vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 8px; color: #111827; font-weight: bold;">1.</td>
                  <td style="padding-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 8px;">Each team must consist of exactly 6 members from the same institution.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 8px; color: #111827; font-weight: bold;">2.</td>
                  <td style="padding-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 8px;">At least one female member is mandatory in every team.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 8px; color: #111827; font-weight: bold;">3.</td>
                  <td style="padding-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 8px;">Registrations are processed solely via College SPOC nomination on the national portal.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 8px; color: #111827; font-weight: bold;">4.</td>
                  <td style="padding-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 8px;">The evaluation team will evaluate your PPT, and will decide whether your team will be allowed to present the PPT during the event rounds.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 8px; color: #111827; font-weight: bold;">5.</td>
                  <td style="padding-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 8px;">Shortlisted teams must be present on 12 September 2026, Saturday at NTB, IIIT Bhopal for presentation and evaluation.</td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- SPOC Contact Info -->
              <div style="border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.55;">
                For any immediate queries or coordination, please contact the institutional SPOC:
                <div style="margin-top: 6px; color: #111827; font-weight: 500;">
                  <strong>{{ spoc_name }}</strong>
                  <br>
                  {{ spoc_role }}
                  <br>
                  Email: <a href="mailto:{{ spoc_email }}" style="color: #111827; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;">{{ spoc_email }}</a>
                </div>
              </div>

            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Footer Area -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background-color: #f9fafb; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding: 20px 32px; text-align: center; font-size: 11px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.5;">
              <p style="margin: 0 0 4px 0;">
                This email was sent as a registration confirmation for Smart India Hackathon 2026 internal processes.
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 500; color: #4b5563;">
                &copy; 2026 Indian Institute of Information Technology, Bhopal. All rights reserved.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</body>
</html>
